{"name":"Mount Talath","status":"ok","title":"Mount Talath","pageId":32648,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the mountain. For the town on its slopes, see <a href=\"/wiki/Mount_Talath_(town)\" title=\"Mount Talath (town)\">Mount Talath (town)</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-theme-mountain pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mount Talath</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p128_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p128-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A.TEoS-p89-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mountain</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nathaghal_Mountains\" title=\"Nathaghal Mountains\">Nathaghal Mountains</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halruaa\" title=\"Halruaa\">Halruaa</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Mount_Talath\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Mount Talath\">Inhabitants of  Mount Talath</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_on_Mount_Talath\" title=\"Category:Locations on Mount Talath\">Locations on  Mount Talath</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations on Mount Talath (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19vbl9Nb3VudF9UYWxhdGg/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Organizations on  Mount Talath</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_on__Mount_Talath&DPL_cat2=Settlements&action=purge\">Settlements  on  Mount Talath</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_on__Mount_Talath&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  on  Mount Talath</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_on__Mount_Talath&DPL_cat2=Mountains&action=purge\">Mountains  on  Mount Talath</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Items from Mount Talath (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9Nb3VudF9UYWxhdGg/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Items from  Mount Talath</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Mount Talath</b> was the name of one of the tallest mountains in the western half of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nathaghal_Mountains\" title=\"Nathaghal Mountains\">Nathaghal range</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Halruaa\" title=\"Halruaa\">Halruaa</a>. It was the site of the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Temple_of_Mystra\" title=\"High Temple of Mystra\">High Temple of Mystra</a> and one of the largest collections of magic in all <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p128_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p128-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A.TEoS-p89-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mount_Talath?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>High Temple of Mystra</dt>\n<dd>A temple dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a> that was sometimes said to be the very center of magic in Halruaa.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-pp139-140-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Mount_Talath_(town)\" title=\"Mount Talath (town)\">Mount Talath</a></dt>\n<dd>\"Mount Talath\" was also the name of the village built on its slope that housed the staff of the temple.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-pp139-140-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-A.TEoS-p89-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Talathgard\" title=\"Talathgard\">Talathgard</a></dt>\n<dd>This fortress defended the mountain, the town, the temple, and even <a href=\"/wiki/Talath_Pass\" title=\"Talath Pass\">Talath Pass</a> to the south.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-pp139-140-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mount_Talath?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mount_Talath?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS-p128-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p128_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p128_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Reid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thomas Reid\">Thomas Reid</a>&#160;(October 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Shining South (sourcebook)\">Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 128. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\">0-7869-3492-1</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-A.TEoS-p89-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-A.TEoS-p89_2-2\">2.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_A._Vaughan\" title=\"Greg A. Vaughan\">Greg A. Vaughan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_M._Reid\" title=\"Thomas M. Reid\">Thomas M. Reid</a>&#160;(November 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch:_The_Empire_of_Shade\" title=\"Anauroch: The Empire of Shade\">Anauroch: The Empire of Shade</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 89. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\">0-7869-4362-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS-pp139-140-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-pp139-140_3-2\">3.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Reid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thomas Reid\">Thomas Reid</a>&#160;(October 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Shining South (sourcebook)\">Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), pp. 139–140. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\">0-7869-3492-1</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>